# Changes to the org-wide secret-scan gate need approval from the
# @publicala/secret-scan-owners team. The repository ruleset
# "secret-scan ownership" enforces this with a required-reviewers rule
# scoped to these file patterns, with no bypass actors. This file is
# the human-readable record of that ownership: GitHub does not resolve
# CODEOWNERS auto-requests in this repository, the ruleset is the
# enforcement.

/CODEOWNERS                         @publicala/secret-scan-owners
/.github/workflows/secret-scan.yml  @publicala/secret-scan-owners

# The repository ruleset requires approval from both teams for the
# Dependabot gate. CODEOWNERS makes the ownership visible in review.
/.github/actions/dependabot-critical-gate/      @publicala/ci-owners @publicala/vuln-review-owners
/.github/workflows/dependabot-critical-gate.yml @publicala/ci-owners @publicala/vuln-review-owners
/.github/workflows/ci.yml                       @publicala/ci-owners @publicala/vuln-review-owners
/package.json                                  @publicala/ci-owners @publicala/vuln-review-owners
/package-lock.json                             @publicala/ci-owners @publicala/vuln-review-owners
/tsconfig.json                                 @publicala/ci-owners @publicala/vuln-review-owners
